{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"morvath","model_identifier":"morvath","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# morvath\n\nMorvath, the Hollow Crown (C3 boss), 4.5 m = 160 u to the crown horn tips (skull top 152 u); smoke wings span 6.8 m (240 u) when unfolded.\n\nThe demon lord: a gaunt, regal skeletal king. A bone skull with six eyes of violet fire (three per side) and a hanging jaw; a crown of hollow black horns on a black band circling the empty space above the skull; an open robe of black smoke over a bare bony ribcage with a violet ember heart, a high collar of bone spikes, wide trailing smoke sleeves over long bone fingers, a smoke hem that frays to wisps at the ground; a 4.5 m staff of bone and black iron topped with a bone skull and an iron claw cage holding violet fire (`fx_staff`). In his second form great smoke wings (wing_* > wing_tip_*) unfold from his back. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (scaled 2.6) plus `jaw`.\n\n- Cubes: 59 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 256x256, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -120.0..120.0, y 0.0..163.0, z -12.0..10.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 44 x 160 x 30 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0; in flight add the wings: 240 wide\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4.2 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.9 | loop |  |\n| `cast_ruin` | 4.2 | once | 3 s wind-up (0-2.9 s: staff and hand rise, fire gathers at fx_staff); key 3.25 s: the ruin is hurled at the target |\n| `open_rift` | 2.4 | once | key 1.2 s: the left hand tears the air open downward (spawn the rift at the target); held to 1.8 |\n| `snuff` | 1.4 | once | key 0.6 s: the sweeping left hand puts out every torch in range |\n| `take_flight` | 2.6 | once | wings unfold from his back (scale 0 -> 1, 0.2-1.0 s), spread by 1.4, downbeat lifts him 30 u by 2.6; ends in the fly pose |\n| `fly` | 1.8 | loop | second form: slow vast wingbeats (loop), root lifted 30 u |\n| `aggro` | 2 | once | staff raised, jaw agape |\n| `injured` | 0.7 | once | flinch |\n| `death` | 2.4 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 (staff lies flat) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 42.7 u/s (1.20 m/s), cycle 1.9 s, 81.1 u per cycle (slow, regal, staff as a walking stick)\n- `fly`: wingbeat 1.8 s; designed for about 6 m/s (213 u/s)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `cast_ruin`: 3 s wind-up (0-2.9 s: staff and hand rise, fire gathers at fx_staff); key 3.25 s: the ruin is hurled at the target\n- `open_rift`: key 1.2 s: the left hand tears the air open downward (spawn the rift at the target); held to 1.8\n- `snuff`: key 0.6 s: the sweeping left hand puts out every torch in range\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 155, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 109.5, 9.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (6.5, 119.5, 9.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (11, 131.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 104, -9.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (23.5, 71.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-28, 89.75, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-23.5, 71.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (13, 76, 7.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-13, 76, 7.5)\n- `fx_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (23.5, 61, -1)\n- `fx_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-23.5, 61, -1)\n- `fx_staff` on `bone_staff` at (23.5, 71.5, -68)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `bone_staff` (visible, under slot_hand_r): 4.5 m bone-and-iron staff (158 u), grip at the origin, head along -Z, butt along +Z\n\n## Notes\n\n- Lit cubes: glow_eye_* (six), glow_heart, glow_staff_fire.\n- Wings use `scale` keys (0 outside take_flight / fly; visible in the bind pose).\n- `fx_hand_l` / `fx_hand_r`: finger tips (snuff, open_rift).\n"},"description":"# morvath\n\nMorvath, the Hollow Crown (C3 boss), 4.5 m = 160 u to the crown horn tips (skull top 152 u); smoke wings span 6.8 m (240 u) when unfolded.\n\nThe demon lord: a gaunt, regal skeletal king. A bone skull with six eyes of violet fire (three per side) and a hanging jaw; a crown of hollow black horns on a black band circling the empty space above the skull; an open robe of black smoke over a bare bony ribcage with a violet ember heart, a high collar of bone spikes, wide trailing smoke sleeves over long bone fingers, a smoke hem that frays to wisps at the ground; a 4.5 m staff of bone and black iron topped with a bone skull and an iron claw cage holding violet fire (`fx_staff`). In his second form great smoke wings (wing_* > wing_tip_*) unfold from his back. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (scaled 2.6) plus `jaw`.\n\n- Cubes: 59 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 256x256, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -120.0..120.0, y 0.0..163.0, z -12.0..10.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 44 x 160 x 30 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0; in flight add the wings: 240 wide\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4.2 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.9 | loop |  |\n| `cast_ruin` | 4.2 | once | 3 s wind-up (0-2.9 s: staff and hand rise, fire gathers at fx_staff); key 3.25 s: the ruin is hurled at the target |\n| `open_rift` | 2.4 | once | key 1.2 s: the left hand tears the air open downward (spawn the rift at the target); held to 1.8 |\n| `snuff` | 1.4 | once | key 0.6 s: the sweeping left hand puts out every torch in range |\n| `take_flight` | 2.6 | once | wings unfold from his back (scale 0 -> 1, 0.2-1.0 s), spread by 1.4, downbeat lifts him 30 u by 2.6; ends in the fly pose |\n| `fly` | 1.8 | loop | second form: slow vast wingbeats (loop), root lifted 30 u |\n| `aggro` | 2 | once | staff raised, jaw agape |\n| `injured` | 0.7 | once | flinch |\n| `death` | 2.4 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 (staff lies flat) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 42.7 u/s (1.20 m/s), cycle 1.9 s, 81.1 u per cycle (slow, regal, staff as a walking stick)\n- `fly`: wingbeat 1.8 s; designed for about 6 m/s (213 u/s)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `cast_ruin`: 3 s wind-up (0-2.9 s: staff and hand rise, fire gathers at fx_staff); key 3.25 s: the ruin is hurled at the target\n- `open_rift`: key 1.2 s: the left hand tears the air open downward (spawn the rift at the target); held to 1.8\n- `snuff`: key 0.6 s: the sweeping left hand puts out every torch in range\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 155, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 109.5, 9.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (6.5, 119.5, 9.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (11, 131.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 104, -9.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (23.5, 71.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-28, 89.75, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-23.5, 71.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (13, 76, 7.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-13, 76, 7.5)\n- `fx_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (23.5, 61, -1)\n- `fx_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-23.5, 61, -1)\n- `fx_staff` on `bone_staff` at (23.5, 71.5, -68)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `bone_staff` (visible, under slot_hand_r): 4.5 m bone-and-iron staff (158 u), grip at the origin, head along -Z, butt along +Z\n\n## Notes\n\n- Lit cubes: glow_eye_* (six), glow_heart, glow_staff_fire.\n- Wings use `scale` keys (0 outside take_flight / fly; visible in the bind pose).\n- `fx_hand_l` / `fx_hand_r`: finger tips (snuff, open_rift).\n","resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-12.0,73.0,-8.0],"to":[12.0,86.0,8.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,73.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[162,282,186.0,295.0],"texture":0